## Accessing Users Home Directories in EFS


User home directories from tooling, such as Visual Studio Code, are mapped from EFS in the `analytical-platform-production` AWS account.

To interact with this cluster in the analytical-platform [development container](https://github.com/ministryofjustice/analytical-platform/tree/main/.devcontainer) use the context for the production EKS cluster - `production-dBSvju9Y`.


Once connected to this use the following command to connect to the `efs-app` pod.

  ```

  # Connect to a busybox container
  kubectl exec -it efs-app -- sh

  # Navigate to /data
  cd /data/

  ```

User directories exist in `/data` and are of the form `/data/<github-username>`.

